{"unit_id":"lj970926__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-1","repo":"lj970926/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"73d08a87f1630c6301c45c0ab822f3a082bdcb23","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mermaid 的功能「图表渲染」：自动识别聊天代码块中的 Mermaid 语言标记，并把源码渲染成 SVG 图表显示在代码块下方。首次绘制时按需加载 Mermaid。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:74-85","lib/client.js:191-218"]}
