{"unit_id":"lj970926__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-3","repo":"lj970926/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"73d08a87f1630c6301c45c0ab822f3a082bdcb23","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mermaid 的功能「跟随内容和主题更新」：观察聊天 DOM 变化，对新增或流式变化的 Mermaid 块进行延迟渲染，并在深浅主题变化时重新绘制已有图表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:220-229","lib/client.js:254-314"]}
{"unit_id":"lj970926__dsh-plugin-mermaid#caveat-1","repo":"lj970926/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"73d08a87f1630c6301c45c0ab822f3a082bdcb23","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mermaid 使用前须知：首次渲染会从 cdn.jsdelivr.net 按需加载 Mermaid v11 模块，因此网页客户端需要能够访问该 CDN。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:14-16","lib/client.js:25-39"]}
